.TH MYGREP 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
mygrep \- search a file for lines containing a pattern
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mygrep(FILE *" fp ", const char *" search_str ", char ***" matches ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mygrep()
searches the file stream pointed to by
.I fp
for lines containing the substring
.IR search_str .
Matching lines are collected into a dynamically allocated array of strings,
whose address is stored in
.IR matches .
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the count of matching lines on success, and \-1 on failure.
